---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Downspout Repair & Installation Woodbridge, VA" description="Downspout repair, replacement, and extensions in Woodbridge, VA. Direct water safely away from the foundation. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Downspouts</div>
      <h1>Downspout Services in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Repair, extend, or replace downspouts so water is carried safely away from the foundation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Damaged or crushed downspout replacement</li>
        <li>Elbows, extensions, and splash blocks</li>
        <li>Underground drain connections where appropriate</li>
        <li>Proper discharge distance from the foundation</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Correct downspout placement is one of the most effective ways to prevent basement moisture and landscape erosion in Woodbridge’s clay-heavy soils.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
